From: Belfry <belfry@localhost>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:44:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Belfry: Sign in with Open Source Village, silently when
 signed in; logout everywhere

src/belfry/sso.ts (as in the chat): OAuth authorization code + PKCE against Keycast, client
belfry-groups, the token response's bunker URL connected over NIP-46. The root layout finishes
the flow on /oauth/callback or tries prompt=none once per tab before the app starts, and opens
the login dialog when that did not work out. The login dialog offers the button first. Logout
revokes the app's authorization and goes through Keycast's logout, which ends the Keycast and
Authentik sessions and comes back signed out.
